**10.1** The Seller shall procure that all Related-Party Arrangements listed in **Schedule 8** are terminated, novated, or otherwise dealt with in accordance with the arrangements specified in Schedule 8 prior to or at Completion, at no cost to the Group Companies.

**10.2** With effect from Completion, neither the Seller nor any member of the Seller's Group shall have any outstanding claims against, or obligations owed by, any Group Company, except as expressly set out in this Agreement.

### 11. FINANCING COOPERATION

**11.1** *[If applicable — ISSUE-5]* The Seller shall, and shall procure that each Group Company shall, provide all reasonable cooperation to the Buyer in connection with the arrangement of the Buyer's debt financing for the Transaction, including:

